(5263912, 765274, 94235, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, unfortunately nothing appears to be in focus.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, unfortunately nothing appears to be in focus.', '2009-02-18 19:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5263915, 765872, 94235, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours. Well shot.</td>', 'Lovely colours. Well shot.', '2009-02-18 19:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5263917, 764789, 94235, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! My ruler tells me you''ve taken a perfectly level horizon shot. Now if the challenge was for that........</td>', 'Congratulations! My ruler tells me you''ve taken a perfectly level horizon shot. Now if the challenge was for that........', '2009-02-18 19:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5263945, 765890, 100727, '<td valign="top">I find the sun too bright.  The reflection on the water is distracting too in my opinion.  It would be just nice if the sun is not in the photo and the couple stands more to the left side of the sun.  Try covering up the sun with a piece of paper or your palm and imagine the couple is standing left to your palm.  It "cool" down the photo a lot and creates a nice scenery.</td>', 'I find the sun too bright.  The reflection on the water is distracting too in my opinion.  It would be just nice if the sun is not in the photo and the couple stands more to the left side of the sun.  Try covering up the sun with a piece of paper or your palm and imagine the couple is standing left to your palm.  It "cool" down the photo a lot and creates a nice scenery.', '2009-02-18 19:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5263947, 765985, 100727, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry.  This photo doesn''t work for me.  It doesn''t give me the tilted feeling.  However, the colour is nice and the composition too.</td>', 'I''m sorry.  This photo doesn''t work for me.  It doesn''t give me the tilted feeling.  However, the colour is nice and the composition too.', '2009-02-18 19:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5263949, 766195, 100727, '<td valign="top">What is going down? :)  I like the reflection on the water but the sun is a bit too bright in my opinion.  The sky is lovely.</td>', 'What is going down? :)  I like the reflection on the water but the sun is a bit too bright in my opinion.  The sky is lovely.', '2009-02-18 19:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5263951, 766281, 100727, '<td valign="top">A nice entry.  However, I find the horizon way too tilted.  I like the colours and the bridge, and also the sky.</td>', 'A nice entry.  However, I find the horizon way too tilted.  I like the colours and the bridge, and also the sky.', '2009-02-18 19:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5263952, 765659, 100727, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photo.  I don''t know how you did it.  The horizon is definitely straight but not the horizon in the glass.  Very creative.</td>', 'This is a wonderful photo.  I don''t know how you did it.  The horizon is definitely straight but not the horizon in the glass.  Very creative.', '2009-02-18 19:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5263958, 766119, 100727, '<td valign="top">Nice scenery and reflection.  I do find the horizon too tilted too.  But it''s a nice shot overall.</td>', 'Nice scenery and reflection.  I do find the horizon too tilted too.  But it''s a nice shot overall.', '2009-02-18 19:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5263962, 766019, 100727, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  I like how it draws my eyes from the foreground to the background, and then slowly to the man sitting on the bench.  Nice composition too.</td>', 'Nice photo.  I like how it draws my eyes from the foreground to the background, and then slowly to the man sitting on the bench.  Nice composition too.', '2009-02-18 19:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5263970, 765800, 100727, '<td valign="top">Such a lovely couple.  Nice models, lake, mountain and clouds.  Good luck in your entry.</td>', 'Such a lovely couple.  Nice models, lake, mountain and clouds.  Good luck in your entry.', '2009-02-18 19:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5263972, 765835, 100727, '<td valign="top">Is this taken from a playground?  The photo is OK to me.  I think the lights on the buildings would be more prominent had the sky been darker.  Right now, the lights on the buildings are pale against the still bright sky.</td>', 'Is this taken from a playground?  The photo is OK to me.  I think the lights on the buildings would be more prominent had the sky been darker.  Right now, the lights on the buildings are pale against the still bright sky.', '2009-02-18 19:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5263976, 766262, 100727, '<td valign="top">This photo doesn''t work for me.  It doesn''t give me any sense of tilting horizon although I can see that the "loves" are not levelled.</td>', 'This photo doesn''t work for me.  It doesn''t give me any sense of tilting horizon although I can see that the "loves" are not levelled.', '2009-02-18 19:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5263986, 766141, 100727, '<td valign="top">Nice entry.  However, I think it could be a better photograph if you had shown more ground.</td>', 'Nice entry.  However, I think it could be a better photograph if you had shown more ground.', '2009-02-18 19:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5263990, 765096, 100727, '<td valign="top">The horizon is definitely tilted, however, it doesn''t really work for me.  I think it''s because the background is too dark.  It would be a better entry had the sky been slightly brighter.</td>', 'The horizon is definitely tilted, however, it doesn''t really work for me.  I think it''s because the background is too dark.  It would be a better entry had the sky been slightly brighter.', '2009-02-18 19:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5263998, 766152, 100727, '<td valign="top">What is this?  I''m sorry but this photo doesn''t give me a sense of tilted horizon.</td>', 'What is this?  I''m sorry but this photo doesn''t give me a sense of tilted horizon.', '2009-02-18 20:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5263999, 766060, 100727, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but this photo doesn''t show me any tilted horizon.  From the photo, the horizon is straight and that''s why the crystal ball doesn''t fall off :)  It''s only the image in the crystal ball is upside down.</td>', 'I''m sorry but this photo doesn''t show me any tilted horizon.  From the photo, the horizon is straight and that''s why the crystal ball doesn''t fall off :)  It''s only the image in the crystal ball is upside down.', '2009-02-18 20:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264005, 766194, 100727, '<td valign="top">Nice entry.  I like the contrast and the composition.  You successfully leads me to the tree :)  I like the shadows.</td>', 'Nice entry.  I like the contrast and the composition.  You successfully leads me to the tree :)  I like the shadows.', '2009-02-18 20:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264007, 766047, 100727, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice entry but I find too much "noise" at the background.  The tree barks are distracting.</td>', 'It''s a nice entry but I find too much "noise" at the background.  The tree barks are distracting.', '2009-02-18 20:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264008, 766320, 100727, '<td valign="top">What a nice surprise.  A new fresh air.  It''s something that I do not expect to see -- tilted horizon and an upside down car.  It creates a belief that the tilted horizon flips the car over :)  Well done.</td>', 'What a nice surprise.  A new fresh air.  It''s something that I do not expect to see -- tilted horizon and an upside down car.  It creates a belief that the tilted horizon flips the car over :)  Well done.', '2009-02-18 20:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264009, 764709, 100727, '<td valign="top">Nice colour.  The exposure is just nice.</td>', 'Nice colour.  The exposure is just nice.', '2009-02-18 20:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264012, 766293, 57447, '<td valign="top">Wish I was there.</td>', 'Wish I was there.', '2009-02-18 20:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264014, 766300, 57447, '<td valign="top">Superb!</td>', 'Superb!', '2009-02-18 20:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264023, 765153, 100727, '<td valign="top">I think the entry would have been better if there''s no black/dark reflection on the water.  The reflection has caused the duck to look darker.  Everything is fine in the photo in my opinion.</td>', 'I think the entry would have been better if there''s no black/dark reflection on the water.  The reflection has caused the duck to look darker.  Everything is fine in the photo in my opinion.', '2009-02-18 20:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
