(5264233, 766128, 50695, '<td valign="top">Outstanding. The title is perfect. The tilted horizon is essential to the effect. The composition is dizzying. Truly an exceptional picture. It''s sad to think of all the DPC voters rushing past this... but that''s life, right? All this beauty around us and we''re too busy to see it. All I can do is give you some blue.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Blue Ribbon - <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'Outstanding. The title is perfect. The tilted horizon is essential to the effect. The composition is dizzying. Truly an exceptional picture. It''s sad to think of all the DPC voters rushing past this... but that''s life, right? All this beauty around us and we''re too busy to see it. All I can do is give you some blue. Posthumous Blue Ribbon - ', '2009-02-18 23:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264235, 765970, 50695, '<td valign="top">Dynamic shot, good composition and good details, nice subtle tilt.</td>', 'Dynamic shot, good composition and good details, nice subtle tilt.', '2009-02-18 23:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264237, 766065, 50695, '<td valign="top">The tilt makes this less sedate, less somber, than it would have been otherwise. That''s a good thing, imho. I love the "color" of this photo. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'The tilt makes this less sedate, less somber, than it would have been otherwise. That''s a good thing, imho. I love the "color" of this photo. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. ', '2009-02-18 23:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5264239, 766176, 50695, '<td valign="top">I just finished reading a Leadbelly biography. This shot reminds me of the work songs, the prison songs, where they hammered stones to the rhythm of their song. I love how everyone''s in a different position, none overlap, but because of the perspective and the silhouetting, you don''t notice this right away. DPC ain''t gonna get this. But here''s a red ribbon for you.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon - <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'I just finished reading a Leadbelly biography. This shot reminds me of the work songs, the prison songs, where they hammered stones to the rhythm of their song. I love how everyone''s in a different position, none overlap, but because of the perspective and the silhouetting, you don''t notice this right away. DPC ain''t gonna get this. But here''s a red ribbon for you. Posthumous Red Ribbon - ', '2009-02-18 23:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
