(5266646, 765352, 93756, '<td valign="top">Love the picture, don''t care for the tilt. The scene is too peaceful to be improved with a tilt IMO.</td>', 'Love the picture, don''t care for the tilt. The scene is too peaceful to be improved with a tilt IMO.', '2009-02-20 18:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5266648, 765753, 93756, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of the tilted frame too. I haven''t seen that before but what fun to play around with it. Your subject matter probably won''t win you any ribbons but nice creativity.</td>', 'Interesting use of the tilted frame too. I haven''t seen that before but what fun to play around with it. Your subject matter probably won''t win you any ribbons but nice creativity.', '2009-02-20 18:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
