(5268377, 766052, 99448, '<td valign="top">This just excellent, I love the way you''ve made the boat upright to give the tilted horizon, and the textures and colours in the boat realy make this stand out.</td>', 'This just excellent, I love the way you''ve made the boat upright to give the tilted horizon, and the textures and colours in the boat realy make this stand out.', '2009-02-22 03:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
