(5269696, 766053, 72103, '<td valign="top">Great photo, but for me teh tilt is going teh wrong way, i''ve tried tiltingteh laptop I''m on and I think it looks better with the ditch coming up at ya....   still a 7</td>', 'Great photo, but for me teh tilt is going teh wrong way, i''ve tried tiltingteh laptop I''m on and I think it looks better with the ditch coming up at ya....   still a 7', '2009-02-23 00:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269706, 766170, 72103, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, that is teh near perfect example of a tilted picture, teh fence balances the tilt perfectly.  If teh exposure and focus had been better thsi woudl have got a 10 from me, as it is an 8</td>', 'In my opinion, that is teh near perfect example of a tilted picture, teh fence balances the tilt perfectly.  If teh exposure and focus had been better thsi woudl have got a 10 from me, as it is an 8', '2009-02-23 01:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269873, 765704, 100495, '<td valign="top">excellent; really space-age and futuristic. I love the converging lines and the well-handled exposure.</td>', 'excellent; really space-age and futuristic. I love the converging lines and the well-handled exposure.', '2009-02-23 06:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269874, 765753, 100495, '<td valign="top">The border is the most interesting thing here. At first it looks overdone and out of place, and then slowly it becomes obvious it isn''t straight and almost becomes another subject. I''ve seen graffiti before, but not a tilted border like this.  Respect.</td>', 'The border is the most interesting thing here. At first it looks overdone and out of place, and then slowly it becomes obvious it isn''t straight and almost becomes another subject. I''ve seen graffiti before, but not a tilted border like this.  Respect.', '2009-02-23 06:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269875, 766103, 100495, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Ribbon for sure.</td>', 'Beautiful. Ribbon for sure.', '2009-02-23 06:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269876, 765840, 100495, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours and DOF. Tells a story with that great bokeh.</td>', 'Beautiful colours and DOF. Tells a story with that great bokeh.', '2009-02-23 06:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269877, 765332, 100495, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image that I''m sure the Canadian tourist board would love to use.<br/> <br/>The only very minor point is that a pin-sharp reflection would have added something, but I guess that''s very difficult over such a large stretch of water.<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'Beautiful image that I''m sure the Canadian tourist board would love to use. The only very minor point is that a pin-sharp reflection would have added something, but I guess that''s very difficult over such a large stretch of water. 8', '2009-02-23 06:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269878, 765091, 100495, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, the border really adds to it.</td>', 'Beautiful image, the border really adds to it.', '2009-02-23 06:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269879, 765768, 100495, '<td valign="top">I love the colours in the sky. It''s a very engaging photo but I think it would look better without the tilt.</td>', 'I love the colours in the sky. It''s a very engaging photo but I think it would look better without the tilt.', '2009-02-23 06:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269880, 765366, 100495, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this Kung Fu kid before.<br/> <br/>Great picture with a real sense of movement and action in the tilt. The pier adds too.<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'I''ve seen this Kung Fu kid before. Great picture with a real sense of movement and action in the tilt. The pier adds too. 8', '2009-02-23 06:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269881, 765884, 100495, '<td valign="top">Great image.  It almost looks like a space ship (had it not been for that woman which the leading lines lead directly to).<br/> <br/>Although I can''t see the horizon, I know where it is from the cloudlines.</td>', 'Great image.  It almost looks like a space ship (had it not been for that woman which the leading lines lead directly to). Although I can''t see the horizon, I know where it is from the cloudlines.', '2009-02-23 06:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269883, 766069, 100495, '<td valign="top">I like the obvious effort you''ve gone to.<br/> <br/>The model''s pose is in conflict with her predicament, which gives it an edge, like she''s enjoying being thrashed.</td>', 'I like the obvious effort you''ve gone to. The model''s pose is in conflict with her predicament, which gives it an edge, like she''s enjoying being thrashed.', '2009-02-23 06:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269884, 765890, 100495, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and human element. Almost like a travel brochure shot.</td>', 'Nice colours and human element. Almost like a travel brochure shot.', '2009-02-23 06:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269885, 766301, 100495, '<td valign="top">The interracting diagonals look cool.  Great contrast. A very clinical look with a lack of people/cars etc.</td>', 'The interracting diagonals look cool.  Great contrast. A very clinical look with a lack of people/cars etc.', '2009-02-23 06:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269886, 766068, 100495, '<td valign="top">Very interesting work.</td>', 'Very interesting work.', '2009-02-23 06:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269888, 766160, 100495, '<td valign="top">Nice clean image, but the background is a little uninspiring. 7.</td>', 'Nice clean image, but the background is a little uninspiring. 7.', '2009-02-23 06:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269889, 766256, 100495, '<td valign="top">I like the various lines intersecting and the clever use of the aircraft contrails parallel to the top frame. Sun on the red wall would have really made it ''pop''.</td>', 'I like the various lines intersecting and the clever use of the aircraft contrails parallel to the top frame. Sun on the red wall would have really made it ''pop''.', '2009-02-23 06:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269890, 765872, 100495, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image but the tilt doesn''t add anything for me.</td>', 'Beautiful image but the tilt doesn''t add anything for me.', '2009-02-23 06:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269891, 765596, 100495, '<td valign="top">Great feeling of movement. The first pic I''ve seen where the tilt it inherent to the subject.</td>', 'Great feeling of movement. The first pic I''ve seen where the tilt it inherent to the subject.', '2009-02-23 06:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269892, 766053, 100495, '<td valign="top">Great processing, and I love the detail on the mountain.</td>', 'Great processing, and I love the detail on the mountain.', '2009-02-23 06:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269893, 766013, 100495, '<td valign="top">Very very good.</td>', 'Very very good.', '2009-02-23 06:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
