(5269895, 766073, 100495, '<td valign="top">Great vignetting at the top and an awesome leading line.<br/> <br/>Possibly let down by the mountains as they ruin the simplicity. of a perfectly flat horizon.</td>', 'Great vignetting at the top and an awesome leading line. Possibly let down by the mountains as they ruin the simplicity. of a perfectly flat horizon.', '2009-02-23 06:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269896, 765558, 100495, '<td valign="top">Nice complementary colours.</td>', 'Nice complementary colours.', '2009-02-23 06:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269897, 766060, 100495, '<td valign="top">Nice work.</td>', 'Nice work.', '2009-02-23 06:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269898, 765496, 100495, '<td valign="top">I''m baffled by the lighting, how the camel second from the right can be lit like that with the moon behind it. It has a dream-like feel to it.</td>', 'I''m baffled by the lighting, how the camel second from the right can be lit like that with the moon behind it. It has a dream-like feel to it.', '2009-02-23 06:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269899, 766284, 100495, '<td valign="top">I like the washed-out bg and the detail in the ship.</td>', 'I like the washed-out bg and the detail in the ship.', '2009-02-23 06:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269900, 765999, 100495, '<td valign="top">I love the processing; looks very industrial.</td>', 'I love the processing; looks very industrial.', '2009-02-23 06:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269901, 765533, 100495, '<td valign="top">The tilt adds movement and action.  Nice picture.</td>', 'The tilt adds movement and action.  Nice picture.', '2009-02-23 06:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269902, 766295, 100495, '<td valign="top">Very bold composition and contrst.</td>', 'Very bold composition and contrst.', '2009-02-23 06:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269903, 765343, 100495, '<td valign="top">Great sky and a realistic photo.</td>', 'Great sky and a realistic photo.', '2009-02-23 06:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269904, 765899, 100495, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and detail. I find the branches on the ground to the right of the tree distracting though. 6</td>', 'Nice colours and detail. I find the branches on the ground to the right of the tree distracting though. 6', '2009-02-23 06:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269905, 765998, 100495, '<td valign="top">Excellent complimentary colours. I think it would be better without the boat behind or with the boat clear of the post.</td>', 'Excellent complimentary colours. I think it would be better without the boat behind or with the boat clear of the post.', '2009-02-23 06:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269906, 765189, 100495, '<td valign="top">Great detail and action.<br/> <br/>Shouldn''t that be ''At the Bottom of the World''? (unless you''re one of those Aussies!)</td>', 'Great detail and action. Shouldn''t that be ''At the Bottom of the World''? (unless you''re one of those Aussies!)', '2009-02-23 06:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269907, 765724, 100495, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot with great colours.</td>', 'Very interesting shot with great colours.', '2009-02-23 06:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269908, 766125, 100495, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. I like the lines the boat left. St Paul''s is a bit of a distraction though.</td>', 'Great lighting. I like the lines the boat left. St Paul''s is a bit of a distraction though.', '2009-02-23 06:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269909, 766171, 100495, '<td valign="top">The pier parallel to the frame bottom works well.  Nice picture.</td>', 'The pier parallel to the frame bottom works well.  Nice picture.', '2009-02-23 06:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269910, 765096, 100495, '<td valign="top">Very nice. How do you get a star filter to work on street lights and not on headlights?</td>', 'Very nice. How do you get a star filter to work on street lights and not on headlights?', '2009-02-23 06:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269911, 764887, 100495, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful effect. I''m sure that without the tilt the picture would look 10 times better. The composition looks awkward because the tilt is so severe and the horse is in a very natural pose, i.e. not working against the tilt.</td>', 'What a beautiful effect. I''m sure that without the tilt the picture would look 10 times better. The composition looks awkward because the tilt is so severe and the horse is in a very natural pose, i.e. not working against the tilt.', '2009-02-23 06:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269912, 766281, 100495, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colouring, but I don''t think the tilt adds to the image.</td>', 'Beautiful colouring, but I don''t think the tilt adds to the image.', '2009-02-23 06:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269913, 766189, 100495, '<td valign="top">I think this is great. I''d prefer it without the tree though</td>', 'I think this is great. I''d prefer it without the tree though', '2009-02-23 06:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269914, 765800, 100495, '<td valign="top">Very witty with a beautiful background.</td>', 'Very witty with a beautiful background.', '2009-02-23 06:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269916, 766019, 100495, '<td valign="top">It has the illusion that the weight of the sitter has tilted the image. Nice.</td>', 'It has the illusion that the weight of the sitter has tilted the image. Nice.', '2009-02-23 06:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269917, 765738, 100495, '<td valign="top">Great photo and well executed.<br/> <br/>My only minor (controllable) change would be to crop out the steps in the foreground to add to the simplicity of the pic and keep my eyes higher.  The steps drag them down.<br/> <br/>My oncontrollable niggle is the wall behind, but without that you wouldn''t have the rest so it''s a given I guess.</td>', 'Great photo and well executed. My only minor (controllable) change would be to crop out the steps in the foreground to add to the simplicity of the pic and keep my eyes higher.  The steps drag them down. My oncontrollable niggle is the wall behind, but without that you wouldn''t have the rest so it''s a given I guess.', '2009-02-23 06:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269918, 765968, 100495, '<td valign="top">Nice clean processing.</td>', 'Nice clean processing.', '2009-02-23 06:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269919, 766176, 100495, '<td valign="top">Great silhouettes. It looks a bit staged (congested and exaggerated action).</td>', 'Great silhouettes. It looks a bit staged (congested and exaggerated action).', '2009-02-23 06:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269920, 766300, 100495, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I like the windfarm on the horizon, sets it off well.</td>', 'Great capture. I like the windfarm on the horizon, sets it off well.', '2009-02-23 06:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269921, 765608, 100495, '<td valign="top">Pretty image.</td>', 'Pretty image.', '2009-02-23 06:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269922, 765003, 100495, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity and the colours.</td>', 'I like the simplicity and the colours.', '2009-02-23 06:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269923, 765976, 100495, '<td valign="top">Nice processing and a great vignette.</td>', 'Nice processing and a great vignette.', '2009-02-23 06:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
