(5270080, 766152, 100495, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this for quite a while and I don''t understand the title I''m afraid. I can''t really see a tie-in to the challenge theme.</td>', 'I''ve looked at this for quite a while and I don''t understand the title I''m afraid. I can''t really see a tie-in to the challenge theme.', '2009-02-23 07:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
