(5272752, 765005, 86447, '<td valign="top">The horizon looks level to me... I''m sorry.   Where''s the tilted horizon?  *sigh*</td>', 'The horizon looks level to me... I''m sorry.   Where''s the tilted horizon?  *sigh*', '2009-02-24 20:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272753, 766123, 86447, '<td valign="top">"...submit a shot with a TILTED horizon used effectively."<br/> <br/>I see the tilt... but not the horizon.</td>', '"...submit a shot with a TILTED horizon used effectively." I see the tilt... but not the horizon.', '2009-02-24 20:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272755, 766141, 86447, '<td valign="top">"...submit a shot with a TILTED horizon used effectively."<br/> <br/>I see the tilt... but not the horizon.    I do like old buildings, though.  :)</td>', '"...submit a shot with a TILTED horizon used effectively." I see the tilt... but not the horizon.    I do like old buildings, though.  :)', '2009-02-24 20:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272756, 765332, 86447, '<td valign="top">FINALLY a photo that needs the tilt to make it work and has a horizon.   Well done.</td>', 'FINALLY a photo that needs the tilt to make it work and has a horizon.   Well done.', '2009-02-24 20:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272757, 764789, 86447, '<td valign="top">"...submit a shot with a TILTED horizon used effectively."<br/> <br/>Is this horizon tilted?   But, really... if I have to ask, I''m thinking it''s not tilted enough to do well in a Tilted Horizon challenge.   I''m sorry.</td>', '"...submit a shot with a TILTED horizon used effectively." Is this horizon tilted?   But, really... if I have to ask, I''m thinking it''s not tilted enough to do well in a Tilted Horizon challenge.   I''m sorry.', '2009-02-24 20:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272761, 765194, 86447, '<td valign="top">I just can''t see the horizon here... But I do see the tilt.   I think you''ve gotta have both to meet this challenge.<br/> <br/>But, the photo is really interesting with the lines and textures.</td>', 'I just can''t see the horizon here... But I do see the tilt.   I think you''ve gotta have both to meet this challenge. But, the photo is really interesting with the lines and textures.', '2009-02-24 20:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272762, 766319, 86447, '<td valign="top">"...submit a shot with a TILTED horizon used effectively."<br/> <br/> <br/>Nice tilted photo... but I can''t find the horizon.   I like the composition... just not in this challenge.</td>', '"...submit a shot with a TILTED horizon used effectively."  Nice tilted photo... but I can''t find the horizon.   I like the composition... just not in this challenge.', '2009-02-24 20:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272764, 766262, 86447, '<td valign="top">"...submit a shot with a TILTED horizon used effectively."<br/> <br/>I don''t see a horizon here...   but I like the shot.   Did she say ''yes''?  :)</td>', '"...submit a shot with a TILTED horizon used effectively." I don''t see a horizon here...   but I like the shot.   Did she say ''yes''?  :)', '2009-02-24 20:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272765, 766152, 86447, '<td valign="top">"...submit a shot with a TILTED horizon used effectively."<br/> <br/>I don''t see a horizon here at all. <br/> <br/>COOL shot, though.</td>', '"...submit a shot with a TILTED horizon used effectively." I don''t see a horizon here at all.  COOL shot, though.', '2009-02-24 20:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272766, 766298, 86447, '<td valign="top">Not quite tilted enough for a tilted horizon shot to me.  It''s tilted... but looks like a mistake.<br/> <br/>Otherwise... a LOVELY image!</td>', 'Not quite tilted enough for a tilted horizon shot to me.  It''s tilted... but looks like a mistake. Otherwise... a LOVELY image!', '2009-02-24 20:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272768, 766251, 86447, '<td valign="top">"...submit a shot with a TILTED horizon used effectively."<br/> <br/>I can''t find a horizon at all... *sigh*</td>', '"...submit a shot with a TILTED horizon used effectively." I can''t find a horizon at all... *sigh*', '2009-02-24 20:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5272769, 766164, 86447, '<td valign="top">Nice tilt... but no Tilted Horizon, I fear.  *sigh*</td>', 'Nice tilt... but no Tilted Horizon, I fear.  *sigh*', '2009-02-24 20:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
