(5272920, 765847, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape, but the tilt seems incidental to make it meet the challenge. I don''t feel it adds anything to the composition.</td>', 'Nice landscape, but the tilt seems incidental to make it meet the challenge. I don''t feel it adds anything to the composition.', '2009-02-24 21:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
