(5273817, 766087, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great shot for the challenge.  Score is beyond my comprehension.  Perhaps a little HDR, a sunset?  Got me...  I quite like the dubious look you''re getting here.  :-)</td>', 'Great shot for the challenge.  Score is beyond my comprehension.  Perhaps a little HDR, a sunset?  Got me...  I quite like the dubious look you''re getting here.  :-)', '2009-02-25 06:41:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5273822, 766262, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yep.  Tilted horizon, corny, saturated, and what I''d definitely say is DPC friendly.  Seriously.  In looking at the TS results, I''d have wagered this was one of the highest scoring ones of the bunch.  Shows what I know, huh?</td>', 'Yep.  Tilted horizon, corny, saturated, and what I''d definitely say is DPC friendly.  Seriously.  In looking at the TS results, I''d have wagered this was one of the highest scoring ones of the bunch.  Shows what I know, huh?', '2009-02-25 06:43:40.000000', NULL, 0),
