(5273859, 766087, 63398, '<td valign="top">I liked this in the challenge.....gave it a 7. It''s one of those shots that there really doesn''t need to be a specific level horizon, so it works very well IMO.</td>', 'I liked this in the challenge.....gave it a 7. It''s one of those shots that there really doesn''t need to be a specific level horizon, so it works very well IMO.', '2009-02-25 07:08:20.000000', NULL, 0),
