(5273862, 764892, 63398, '<td valign="top">I like the silhouette &amp; sun blast. The sky seems to have banding on my monitor and I''m sure the sun flare got you knocked down by the technically correct gurus that didn''t understand that it''s intentional. Nice image!</td>', 'I like the silhouette & sun blast. The sky seems to have banding on my monitor and I''m sure the sun flare got you knocked down by the technically correct gurus that didn''t understand that it''s intentional. Nice image!', '2009-02-25 07:10:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5273864, 766262, 63398, '<td valign="top">Underrated.....should have been into the 5s IMO. It does lack a certain pizazz, but it''s not a 4s shot. Very cute concept.</td>', 'Underrated.....should have been into the 5s IMO. It does lack a certain pizazz, but it''s not a 4s shot. Very cute concept.', '2009-02-25 07:11:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5273865, 765965, 63398, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6 ''cause I liked the way the image conveys a sense of being off balance......it makes me want to reach my hand out and steady myself. Well done, IMO.</td>', 'I gave this a 6 ''cause I liked the way the image conveys a sense of being off balance......it makes me want to reach my hand out and steady myself. Well done, IMO.', '2009-02-25 07:12:59.000000', NULL, 0),
