(5273882, 766194, 19670, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments, all. The title was simply a reference to the dead wood that makes up the walkway, leading to the living tree.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments, all. The title was simply a reference to the dead wood that makes up the walkway, leading to the living tree.', '2009-02-25 07:43:07.000000', NULL, 0),
